			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://briefly.eric.pe/@iamEAP\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>iamEAP</span></a></span> to be clear—I agree with the first and third sentences—I want to see those red flags as early as possible in the marketing material</p>",
