			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@sil\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>sil</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@jaffathecake\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>jaffathecake</span></a></span> like the test for website is \"does it have pages (as opposed to views)\", \"can it be edited (or is it only consumed)\", stuff like that. it's all about programmatic functionality vs. viewing linked resources</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
