			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@sil\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>sil</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@jaffathecake\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>jaffathecake</span></a></span> Nice quote. I've long had an inkling to write a treatise on the false dichotomy between \"doc\" and \"app\". This one sentence spares me paragraphs.</p>",
