			"date": "2023-01-31T12:34:06.096Z",
			"content": "<span class=\"h-card\"><a class=\"u-url mention\" href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a class=\"u-url mention\" href=\"https://mastodon.social/@jaffathecake\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>jaffathecake</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a class=\"u-url mention\" href=\"https://paquita.masto.host/@juandjara\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>juandjara</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a class=\"u-url mention\" href=\"https://mastodon.social/@sil\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>sil</span></a></span> probably I'm being an old, though, and should just give up on the content web and move to Gemini.",
